Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 06:50:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ui: float glass navigation and stabilize repeated fast upward
 swipes

Share navigation behavior with the other Harmony Tachiyomi fork. Complete short upward intents with density-scaled release velocity without overriding a touch reveal. Protect a touch that catches an upward fling from a small reverse wobble; preserve deliberate reverse, boundary reveal, pinning and all content velocity. Add one rounded, inset glass capsule with a spring selection lens, drag-to-preview and release-to-select. Keep badges and labels, measured bottom clearance, static More behavior and Anikku cast/tab preferences. Regression tests cover release/cancellation sequences, touch scrolling, capsule geometry and drag/click routing.
